<section class="manifesto" data-scene="code-idle">
  <p class="section-label">(01) Approach</p>
  <p class="manifesto-text">
    Most scanners shout. Plenger reads. It follows untrusted input wherever it leads, has a
    model take a close look, then a skeptic take another. What survives is a finding worth
    fixing, with the lines to prove it.
  </p>
</section>
